{"name":"Nelderild","status":"ok","title":"Neldorild","pageId":48806,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Neldorild</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Coastal City</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Menesankh\" title=\"Menesankh\">Menesankh</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires\" title=\"Old Empires\">Old Empires</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p181_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p181-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Istishia\" title=\"Istishia\">Istishia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nephthys\" title=\"Nephthys\">Nephthys</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">40,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Neldorild (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfTmVsZG9yaWxkP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Inhabitants of  Neldorild</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Neldorild\" title=\"Category:Locations in Neldorild\">Locations in  Neldorild</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Neldorild</b> was a the fourth largest city in <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a> and was still relatively new around that time.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n\n<p>Neldorild was located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Menesankh\" title=\"Menesankh\">Menesankh</a> region of Mulhorand, the southern coast of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alamber_Sea\" title=\"Alamber Sea\">Alamber Sea</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compared to the other major cities of Mulhorand, Neldorild was a new city, with constant construction projects occurring at any given time. <sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Located several miles down the coast, the small port of <a href=\"/wiki/Rasolind\" title=\"Rasolind\">Rasolind</a> served as a supply station for both the city and the fishing fleet out of <a href=\"/wiki/Delgora\" title=\"Delgora\">Delgora</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>A large temple dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Istishia\" title=\"Istishia\">Istishia</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vault_of_Golden_Commerce\" title=\"Vault of Golden Commerce\">Vault of Golden Commerce</a>, a temple dedicated to the goddess <a href=\"/wiki/Nephthys\" title=\"Nephthys\">Nephthys</a> and the central temple of her worship in Mulhorand.<sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p118_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p118-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Many rich <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorandi\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mulhorandi\">Mulhorandi</a> came to Neldorild to retire and enjoy the rest of their lives. The priesthood of <a href=\"/wiki/Nephthys\" title=\"Nephthys\">Nephthys</a> ruled the city. Counting slaves, Neldorild had a population of 40,000.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Neldorild?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE-p18-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p18_1-6\">1.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Bennie\" title=\"Scott Bennie\">Scott Bennie</a>&#160;(February 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Old Empires (sourcebook)\">Old Empires</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Breault\" title=\"Mike Breault\">Mike Breault</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 18. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388214\" title=\"Spec